    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/9fce327b5842d7ed950cc510da881656.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span>The game is about the person named Harold, but he doesn't know who he is and where he is. Only way to find out is to push further on the way what it's awaiting for him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon later he will meet the group of people who got stuck in somewhere unknown place and they have to work together to get out of here. But that's going to be hard for the group, to avoid all bad things and their shadows is trying to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide the story of this game they are going to be peacefully and happy or they will be suffering and in dangers. No matters what, it's all up to you what it will going to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/b594ee0f790f3ee66c0e83bfb184c344.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game have total 3 Chapters to be playing. Every Chapters is 30-35 minutes playtime.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15-20 minutes playtime for speedrun to end of chapter.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/d620bd40fed956b040724377fc706152.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/5597b25989fc66018f4d5fa21f71a54d.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game have feature Playable Characters, while story progress from playing. You will be able to play different characters depends how far they are and something going to happened.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/01cfdcf469b394df287820083687a152.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/2b3494a0a060bf190a0041e49ac7ad50.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful what you choose the path you wish to see the outcome of the gameplay and characters.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path has the fate that could be different for the story whenever it comes for characters or advantages.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/78ea050f549c3a96e84fb735c9db05fc.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/1041d1e29ef975687ca634a304f5ad48.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains 7 endings, 3 endings have special titles for earning it.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's only 7 bad endings, not a good or true ending.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/9fce327b5842d7ed950cc510da881656.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span>The game is about the person named Harold, but he doesn't know who he is and where he is. Only way to find out is to push further on the way what it's awaiting for him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon later he will meet the group of people who got stuck in somewhere unknown place and they have to work together to get out of here. But that's going to be hard for the group, to avoid all bad things and their shadows is trying to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide the story of this game they are going to be peacefully and happy or they will be suffering and in dangers. No matters what, it's all up to you what it will going to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/b594ee0f790f3ee66c0e83bfb184c344.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game have total 3 Chapters to be playing. Every Chapters is 30-35 minutes playtime.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15-20 minutes playtime for speedrun to end of chapter.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/d620bd40fed956b040724377fc706152.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/5597b25989fc66018f4d5fa21f71a54d.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game have feature Playable Characters, while story progress from playing. You will be able to play different characters depends how far they are and something going to happened.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/01cfdcf469b394df287820083687a152.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/2b3494a0a060bf190a0041e49ac7ad50.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful what you choose the path you wish to see the outcome of the gameplay and characters.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path has the fate that could be different for the story whenever it comes for characters or advantages.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/78ea050f549c3a96e84fb735c9db05fc.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794320/extras/1041d1e29ef975687ca634a304f5ad48.avif?t=1751288904\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains 7 endings, 3 endings have special titles for earning it.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's only 7 bad endings, not a good or true ending.</strong></p></li></ul>",
